:: Thomas Hang Out Park [nobr]

/* LOCATION */
<<set $Location to {
	Name: "Thomas Park Hang Out",
    Indoors: 0,
    Safe: 0,
    Nudity: 0,
    Public: 1,
    Environment: "Park",
}>>

/* End Late Check */
<<if $Time.after(18)>>
    <<if $HangOutNeed.Fun < 50>>
        <<goto "Thomas Hang Out End Late Low Fun">>
    <<else>>
        <<goto "Thomas Hang Out End Late High Fun">>
    <</if>>
<<else>>
    <span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Opal City Park--</strong></big></span><br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Thomas",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

    <strong><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>: </strong>
    <<include"NPC Hang Out Modifiers">><br>
    <br>

    You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> stand in the city park. It is a fairly large patch of greenery in the center of the city that, despite being a popular spot, always has plenty of open space for activities. The park has a lot of sidewalk trails that curve around throughout the entire park. There is also a small lake near one corner along with quite a few open fields that can be used for all sorts of things. Along one corner is also a fenced-in playground that has a lot more attractions than the one at your school. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Damn, it's bright out here.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> frowns, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I don't get why people love sunny days.”</span><br>
    <br>

    <span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Talk-</strong></span><br>
    <<include"Thomas Base Talk Code">>

    <span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Actions-</strong></span><br>
    <<link"Play on Playground (0:20)">>
        <<set _events to ["Thomas Hang Out Park Playground Basic", "Thomas Hang Out Park Massage"]>>
        <<set _event to _events.random()>>
        <<goto _event>>
    <</link>>
    <span style="color:green">+Fun</span><br>
    [[Sit & Chat (0:10)|Thomas Hang Out Park Sit & Chat]] <span style="color:green">+Energy</span><br>
    <br>

    <span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Travel-</strong></span><br>
    <<link"Leave for today<br>">>
        <<if $HangOutNeed.Fun < 50>>
            <<goto "Thomas Hang Out End Early Low Fun">>
        <<else>>
            <<goto "Thomas Hang Out End Early High Fun">>
        <</if>>
    <</link>>

<</if>>
